eplace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YcE8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e9421bd-461a-4be3-aadc-16e1389c2f9e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"今朝から copilot で遊んでるけど、想像範囲内ではあるけど期待以上ではある。","ts":"1625105996.106800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+R6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2c82b01-9498-4ec2-841a-fd5d2969f1b5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://togetter.com/li/1738555\u003e\ndiscordとslack...w","ts":"1625094334.106100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Togetter: 使用例が具体的過ぎるｗアプデ報告で急に人間性を見せてくるDiscordくん","id":1,"title":"使用例が具体的過ぎるｗアプデ報告で急に人間性を見せてくるDiscordくん","title_link":"https://togetter.com/li/1738555","text":"つい読んでしまうからまんまと策にハマってる感ｗ","thumb_url":"https://s.togetter.com/ogp/6a43c77423b95109b78728fd04b58916-1200x630.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Togetter","service_icon":"https://s.togetter.com/static/1.16.02/web/img/tg/icon/apple-icon-57x57.png","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":630,"from_url":"https://togetter.com/li/1738555","original_url":"https://togetter.com/li/1738555"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w2xJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45f7a329-2144-45f4-8fa7-69cd9068f0ca","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"特許については気にしてなかった、そういえばなんかあったよね、くらいw","ts":"1625088006.105700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"52hRv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e19825fa-a90e-4d9c-ad39-266900e473ea","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"なるほど。となると、頑張って同じようなソフトウェアを再実装するしか。OSSはデファクトを利用する時間を縮めるために利用しているのだろうし。プロプラやMITだとフィードバックは確実じゃないしforkもいっぱいできるだろうけど。それは作者(個人または組織)が意図しているかどうかはわからないけど。","ts":"1625072502.105200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HWPID"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B40266C3-575E-4780-A5D5-B4AEB7EFA509","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"特許侵害の訴訟を起こしてはならないと明記されてるってことですね。利用者にとっては安心なんですけど、組込だと結構厳しい。\n\n\u003chttp://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/11/gplv3.html|http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/11/gplv3.html\u003e","ts":"1625069265.101200","attachments":[{"fallback":"漢(オトコ)のコンピュータ道: GPLv3とソフトウェア特許","id":1,"title":"GPLv3とソフトウェア特許","title_link":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/11/gplv3.html","text":"GPLv3にはソフトウェア特許についての言及（GPLv3 第11条）がなされているが、どうもこの点については誤解が多く人々がGPLv3の利用を躊躇する理由になっているように思う。GPLv3の特許条項はGPLv3に対するFUDの元凶になっているように思う。実は筆者は最近 「GPLv...","image_url":"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_3l-X4JQ1EX4/TO08qH8i5oI/AAAAAAAAAeg/y4BDwEMWhiU/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/Screenshot+-+11252010+-+01%253A22%253A19+AM.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"漢(オトコ)のコンピュータ道","service_icon":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/11/gplv3.html","original_url":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/11/gplv3.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"27/M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"59bc5134-1669-4236-9460-7991213eac54","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"パテントというか、特許は、著作権と法律的な立て付けが違うので、どう許さないんだろうか。","ts":"1625068467.098900","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1625068553.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"87n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6794281c-ee7e-4dba-b9a7-7837dda69020","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あとはまぁパテントか。ソフトウェアのパテントは悪、絶対に許さんっていう思想がGPL v3にはありますね。","ts":"1625067547.096700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"java","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U8h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df487877-9140-42ce-89a1-6937d464e094","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"tioization対策を二行で雑にようやくするとこんな感じのやつですね\nGPLv2「ソースコードは自由に改変していいよ (でもちょっとでも改変したら絶対にこれ動かない罠を仕込んでおいたぜ)」\nGPLv3「ソースコードは自由に改変していいし、改変したときはこの方法で動かせれるよ」","ts":"1625067434.095900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uGI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30698d39-0191-4dcc-bf6d-bccb33635e8d","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"脆弱性を含んだコードがどんどん量産されたりしないのか、仕組み興味深いですね","ts":"1625067422.095700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zJV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bc7c0b7-ab8d-4e82-9d65-82361e276948","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"GPL v3 を組み込んだのであれば、それを使う製品所有者が自由に改変できるべきって思想はまぁわかるんですけどね。","ts":"1625067317.093500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ua6y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce0bee63-4a67-4883-a57c-514cdd61f057","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ですね。簡単に言えば、GPLv3のソフトを組み込んで販売するのであれば、そのインストール方法（もし認証がいるのであれば、それらも含めてすべて）を開示せよってやつ","ts":"1625067104.092100","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1625067183.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"daiji","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RTh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"92793fba-8693-4798-b2fd-05fc40665ef9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"情報開示はtivoizationまわりのやつですね","ts":"1625066959.090900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7U/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1cd6f72b-2feb-4cfc-9f88-a0356ee41adb","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"2と3の違いについては、この資料が分かりやすいですね。\n\u003chttps://www.ipa.go.jp/files/000028288.pdf\u003e","ts":"1625066688.090300","team":"T03C4RC8